WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.422
Danny: Hello? Hopian?

2
00:00:18.423 --> 00:00:20.682
Tina: Is anybody here?

3
00:00:20.683 --> 00:00:25.388
Danny: Hopian? Hello!

4
00:00:25.389 --> 00:00:27.650
Brad: I don’t know about this place . . .

5
00:00:27.651 --> 00:00:29.258
My computer is wet.

6
00:00:29.259 --> 00:00:31.418
Brad: I’m afraid it will freeze.

7
00:00:31.419 --> 00:00:34.294
Tina: I’m more afraid that we’ll freeze!

8
00:00:34.295 --> 00:00:37.670
Danny: Where’s Hopian?

9
00:00:37.671 --> 00:00:39.674
Tina: Well, not right here.

10
00:00:39.675 --> 00:00:41.249
That’s for sure.

11
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.885
Brad: What should we do?

12
00:00:42.886 --> 00:00:47.216
Tina: We need to do something to stay warm!

13
00:00:47.217 --> 00:00:50.158
Danny: Let’s split up and look around.

14
00:00:50.159 --> 00:00:52.934
Brad: Do you think that’s a good idea?

15
00:00:52.935 --> 00:00:55.482
Tina: At least it will get us moving!

16
00:00:55.483 --> 00:00:58.888
We’re starting to freeze!

17
00:00:58.889 --> 00:01:03.499
Danny: Let’s stay close enough that we can still hear each other.

18
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.559
Danny: Tina, Brad, can you hear me?

19
00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.318
Tina: Loud and clear!

20
00:01:08.319 --> 00:01:11.153
Brad: You haven’t gone very far, Danny!

21
00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:15.024
Danny: Just checking.

22
00:01:15.025 --> 00:01:18.419
Brad: Do you guys know how cold it is in here?

23
00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:19.837
Tina & Danny: Very?

24
00:01:19.838 --> 00:01:23.474
Brad: It’s -20 degrees Celsius!

25
00:01:23.475 --> 00:01:28.230
We could freeze in here!

26
00:01:28.231 --> 00:01:36.028
Brad: Hey guys?

27
00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:41.627
Tina: Danny! Brad!

28
00:01:41.628 --> 00:01:47.153
Danny: Tina, Brad! Where did you guys go!

29
00:01:47.154 --> 00:01:49.685
Tina: Have you two found anything?

30
00:01:49.686 --> 00:01:54.929
Tina: I see piles of snow everywhere, but I can’t see what’s underneath them.

31
00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:59.773
Tina: I’m coming back to you now!

32
00:01:59.774 --> 00:02:02.475
Tina: Where are you guys?

33
00:02:02.476 --> 00:02:07.621
Hello? Guys! This isn’t funny.

34
00:02:07.622 --> 00:02:11.856
Tina: Fine, I can find you myself.

35
00:02:11.857 --> 00:02:14.491
I know you’re over here somewhere.

36
00:02:14.492 --> 00:02:17.213
Tina: Could one of you please say something?

37
00:02:17.214 --> 00:02:24.818
Tina: I’m getting scared. Danny? Brad?

38
00:02:24.819 --> 00:02:28.376
Tina: Oh no, Brad! You’re frozen!

39
00:02:28.377 --> 00:02:30.189
Brad, can you hear me?

40
00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:33.338
Tina: Danny, Brad’s frozen!

41
00:02:33.339 --> 00:02:35.728
Danny! Can you hear me?

42
00:02:35.729 --> 00:02:37.809
Tina: Danny, I need your help!

43
00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:39.756
Just wait a minute, Brad.

44
00:02:39.757 --> 00:02:47.190
Tina: I’m going to look for him.

45
00:02:47.191 --> 00:02:54.590
Tina: Oh no, not you too, Danny!
